    "concerns": [
      "Increase Damage Given rises from a +5% maximum to +7% (Loom of Dusk, Barbed Thread, Cloak of Woven Night, Umbral Whetstone) and +6% on the Burst route; it is the tree's highest-leverage tag because the three self buffs compound (×1.42³ ≈ ×2.86 against ×2.46 when all three windows overlap).",
      "Burst trades raw Damage for buff leverage: over one assumed rotation (Shell with Domain, then Step, Severance, Dance) it is estimated at about +14% against about +16% for the old +5 Damage route, with no tier jump (not simulated). If the director wants Burst to read as raw burst, +3 Damage on Night Unraveled (40 → 43, still Normal) instead of its +2% Increase Damage Given is the alternative.",
      "Suppression and Fortress each rest on one element-less row that the current resolver cannot reach (G1)."
